WEBVTT

1
00:00:09.545 --> 00:00:17.320
Izzie walked to the gym after the first day of school.

2
00:00:17.321 --> 00:00:20.351
Usually she loved going to Kids Central.

3
00:00:20.352 --> 00:00:24.080
But today she felt sad.

4
00:00:24.081 --> 00:00:27.733
Bobby was playing soccer, so he wasn't coming back this year.

5
00:00:27.734 --> 00:00:30.697
And Jason's dad was working from home now.

6
00:00:30.698 --> 00:00:33.824
That meant Jason wasn't coming back either.

7
00:00:33.825 --> 00:00:41.820
She sighed. "Kids Central is going to stink this year."

8
00:00:41.821 --> 00:00:47.852
As she entered the gym, Izzie saw Nina and Ethan sitting at a table.

9
00:00:47.853 --> 00:00:51.331
"Nina!" Izzie hugged her friend.

10
00:00:51.332 --> 00:00:55.236
"Hi, Ethan!" Ethan looked very tan.

11
00:00:55.237 --> 00:00:57.316
And his hair was long!

12
00:00:57.317 --> 00:01:00.377
"Welcome back, everyone," Miss Shelly said.

13
00:01:00.378 --> 00:01:03.562
"I have a surprise to share with you. I—"

14
00:01:03.563 --> 00:01:07.203
Boom! Just then the door flew open.

15
00:01:07.204 --> 00:01:10.295
And Bobby walked in—on crutches!

16
00:01:10.296 --> 00:01:12.976
"No soccer for me," he said.

17
00:01:12.977 --> 00:01:16.811
"I broke my leg jumping into the river this summer."

18
00:01:16.812 --> 00:01:19.119
"Ouch," Ethan said.

19
00:01:19.120 --> 00:01:22.928
"We're happy to see you, Bobby," Miss Shelly said.

20
00:01:22.929 --> 00:01:27.926
The door opened again. Nina gasped. "Jason?"

21
00:01:27.927 --> 00:01:30.916
Jason came into the gym, grinning.

22
00:01:30.917 --> 00:01:33.464
"My dad is working at his office again.

23
00:01:33.465 --> 00:01:36.018
So I'm back at Kids Central!"

24
00:01:36.019 --> 00:01:41.619
Nina clapped. "We're all together again!"

25
00:01:41.620 --> 00:01:44.834
"Miss Shelly, what are we doing today?" Jason asked.

26
00:01:44.835 --> 00:01:47.409
"I hope we're cooking!"

27
00:01:47.410 --> 00:01:51.186
Miss Shelly shook her head and pointed to three tables.

28
00:01:51.187 --> 00:01:53.738
Each table had different things on it.

29
00:01:53.739 --> 00:01:56.703
"We're making time capsules."

30
00:01:56.704 --> 00:02:01.763
"For time travel?" Bobby asked. "Cool!"

31
00:02:01.764 --> 00:02:05.386
"Not exactly," Miss Shelly said.

32
00:02:05.387 --> 00:02:08.788
"You'll put items in the capsules today.

33
00:02:08.789 --> 00:02:14.023
Then we'll save them for a date in the future.

34
00:02:14.024 --> 00:02:18.067
It will feel like time travel when you open them."

35
00:02:18.068 --> 00:02:21.211
"What do we do first?" Bobby asked.

36
00:02:21.212 --> 00:02:23.462
"Go to the first table.

37
00:02:23.463 --> 00:02:30.648
We'll make handprints and take photos," Miss Shelly said.

38
00:02:30.649 --> 00:02:36.521
"Ooh, I'm making pink handprints!"

39
00:02:36.522 --> 00:02:41.369
Izzie carefully traced her hands with a pink marker.

40
00:02:41.370 --> 00:02:44.662
"They look like flamingos."

41
00:02:44.663 --> 00:02:49.181
"Say 'cheese.'"

42
00:02:49.182 --> 00:02:55.213
Miss Shelly snapped photos of Izzie and the other kids.

43
00:02:55.214 --> 00:02:58.350
The next station had pencils and clipboards.

44
00:02:58.351 --> 00:03:00.347
Izzie picked up a clipboard.

45
00:03:00.356 --> 00:03:04.712
"Now we're supposed to write things about ourselves."

46
00:03:04.713 --> 00:03:07.104
She ran to Ethan.

47
00:03:07.105 --> 00:03:10.917
"I'll fill out yours, and you can fill out mine."

48
00:03:10.918 --> 00:03:12.836
Ethan nodded.

49
00:03:12.837 --> 00:03:17.352
"What's your favorite food and activity?" Izzie asked.

50
00:03:17.353 --> 00:03:22.354
"Fish tacos and surfing," Ethan said. "What's yours?"

51
00:03:22.355 --> 00:03:28.313
"Easy. Strawberry ice cream and kickball," Izzie said.

52
00:03:28.314 --> 00:03:33.689
"Next question. What do you want to learn this year?"

53
00:03:33.690 --> 00:03:37.594
"How to build a rocket ship," he answered.

54
00:03:37.595 --> 00:03:41.382
"I want to learn how to play the trumpet."

55
00:03:41.383 --> 00:03:44.659
Soon Izzie moved on to the next table.

56
00:03:44.660 --> 00:03:48.554
She saw empty paper towel rolls and tissue paper.

57
00:03:48.555 --> 00:03:52.478
"What's the tissue paper for?" Nina asked.

58
00:03:52.479 --> 00:03:56.042
Miss Shelly held up an empty paper towel roll.

59
00:03:56.043 --> 00:03:58.843
"This will be your capsule.

60
00:03:58.844 --> 00:04:03.750
After you put everything inside, wrap it in tissue paper.

61
00:04:03.751 --> 00:04:08.937
Then seal the time capsule with tape and decorate it."

62
00:04:08.938 --> 00:04:13.397
The kids nodded and got to work.

63
00:04:13.398 --> 00:04:17.462
Izzie slipped her paper, handprints, and photo into the capsule.

64
00:04:17.463 --> 00:04:21.964
Next she wrapped it in green tissue.

65
00:04:21.965 --> 00:04:26.423
She smiled happily as she looked up at her friends.

66
00:04:26.424 --> 00:04:29.155
"I was wrong," she thought.

67
00:04:29.156 --> 00:04:35.610
"This year is going to be awesome!"
